title: "LinkOutage"
abstract: "Outage and availability statistics for an optical link — fade-duration distributions, level-crossing rates, outage probability and availability from a seeded or supplied amplitude series, Markov and semi-Markov channel-state fitting with a goodness-of-fit report; short-horizon outage classifier against the analytic level-crossing-rate predictor and a logistic-regression baseline with calibration reported."
